TO RUN MECANUM WHEELS WITH ODOMETRY:

JETSON SIDE:
1. RUN MICROROS (9999)
2. RUN JOY NODE
3. RUN mecanum_odo.py (from github)

TEENSY SIDE:
1. UPLOAD mecanum_odometry.ino TO THE TEENSY


ARCHITECTURE OF THE CODE:

_________________________________________________________________________________________________
| Topic          | Publisher             | Subscriber            | Purpose                      |
| -------------- | --------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| `/joy`         | joy_node              | JetsonRobotController | Controller joystick input    |
| `/target_rpm`  | JetsonRobotController | Teensy micro-ROS node | Individual wheel target RPMs |
| `/teensy_odom` | Teensy micro-ROS node | JetsonRobotController | Robot X, Y and heading       |
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Debug Accordingly

